{# Part 4: what happened since, numbered so every keepsake can cite its source: the talk (L), the other things the
   persona noticed (N, each with when it happened), and what it was aware of while talking (C). #}
[ user ]
WHAT HAPPENED SINCE
Talk:
{% if talk_cut %}(the oldest lines are left out)
{% endif %}
{% for l in lines %}
{{ l.id }} {{ l.who }}: {{ quote(l.text) }}
{% endfor %}
{% if empty(lines) %}(none)
{% endif %}
Other things {{ name }} noticed:
{% for n in notes %}
{{ n.id }} {{ n.text }} ({{ n.when }})
{% endfor %}
{% if empty(notes) %}(none)
{% endif %}
What {{ name }} was aware of while talking:
{% for c in context %}
{{ c.id }} {{ c.text }}
{% endfor %}
{% if empty(context) %}(none)
{% endif %}
